# Vito, Fanatic of Aclazotz: "Whenever you sacrifice another permanent, you gain 2 life if this is the first time this ability has resolved
# this turn. If it's the second time, each opponent loses 2 life. If it's the third time, create a 4/3 white and black Vampire Demon
# creature token with flying." Turn 3: Bankrupt in Blood's cost sacrifices two Ornithopters at once, two triggers: the first resolution
# gains 2 life (22), the second makes Bot2 lose 2 (18); it draws three more Ornithopters. Turn 5 (the count starts over): Ashnod's
# Altar sacrifices Ornithopters one at a time: the first resolution of the turn gains 2 (24), the second drains 2 (Bot2 16), the third makes
# the 4/3 flying Demon, and the fourth, sacrificing that Demon, does nothing (CR 608.2m). Turn 7: Bot1's Diabolic Edict makes Bot2 sacrifice its Ornithopter, which does not trigger Vito (only a sacrifice
# "you" make). CR 701.21a.

